    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that there are two sides, but like, if you look at the actual long-term impact on the region, doesn't the stability issue kind of outweigh the humanitarian stuff? it feels like even if they saved people in the short term, the resulting chaos in north africa makes the whole thing look like a strategic failure. what do you think?",
